This directory contains Next.js server actions.

Files (created by Smarak):
  server/
    actions/
      quests.ts         — createQuest, updateQuest, deleteQuest, completeQuest
      progression.ts    — chooseSpecialization, startTrial, claimTrial
      economy.ts        — purchaseItem, equipItem
      snapshot.ts       — getGameSnapshot
      preferences.ts    — updatePreferences

All server actions call Supabase RPC functions and return MutationResult.
Owned by Smarak.
